- [Crow] My pleasure, glad to do it.

1137
00:49:18,475 --> 00:49:19,725
Let's do lunch.

1138
00:49:24,019 --> 00:49:27,269
- [Tom] Don't lose your happy thoughts.

1139
00:49:28,877 --> 00:49:29,851
