- [Tom] It's not easy being green.

1143
00:49:37,240 --> 00:49:40,140
- [Joel] I'm curious, but yellow.

1144
00:49:40,140 --> 00:49:42,902
- [Tom] Ah, frog and a
bird, together again.

1145
00:49:42,902 --> 00:49:44,569
Wocka, wocka, wocka.

1146
00:49:45,648 --> 00:49:46,815
- [Crow] What?

1147
00:49:47,726 --> 00:49:51,143
(eerie orchestral music)

1148
00:49:54,249 --> 00:49:56,140
- [Crow] Here's the
