1155
00:50:19,248 --> 00:50:21,331
- [Crow] Not by my watch.

1156
00:50:23,272 --> 00:50:24,666
10.--

1157
00:50:24,666 --> 00:50:25,499
- [Joel] 13.

1158
00:50:25,499 --> 00:50:26,555
- [Crow] Eight.

1159
00:50:26,555 --> 00:50:27,388
- [Whitsun] Eight.

1160
00:50:27,388 --> 00:50:28,312
- [Joel] 2,000,000.

1161
00:50:28,312 --> 00:50:29,464
- [Crow] 49.

1162
