1165
00:50:36,380 --> 00:50:37,253
- [Whitsun] Two.

1166
00:50:37,253 --> 00:50:38,129
- [Joel] One.

1167
00:50:38,129 --> 00:50:38,962
- [Whitsun] One.

1168
00:50:38,962 --> 00:50:39,795
- [Crow] Thump.

1169
00:50:39,795 --> 00:50:40,628
- [Tom] Thump.

1170
00:50:40,628 --> 00:50:44,545
