1171
00:50:50,214 --> 00:50:53,547
- [Joel] Space sounds by Chuck Mangione.

1172
00:50:54,475 --> 00:50:55,725
- [Crow] Yahoo.

1173
00:50:57,094 --> 00:50:58,177
A real yahoo.

1174
00:51:02,758 --> 00:51:05,746
- He has five seconds to get free.

1175
00:51:05,746 --> 00:51:08,413
- [Tom] Five, four, three, shew.

1176
00:51:11,708 --> 00:51:14,131
- [Crow] Hey, it looks
like his stone passed him.

1177
00:51:14,131 --> 00:51:16,692
- What would have happened if he'd failed?

1178
00:51:16,692 --> 00:51:19,054
- He'd have ended up in his socks.

1179
00:51:19,054 --> 00:51:19,887
- [Joel] At least he would have died

1180
00:51:19,887 --> 00:51:22,220
with his birthstone, though.

1181
00:51:23,994 --> 00:51:25,247
- Are you okay, Bill?

1182
00:51:25,247 --> 00:51:27,747
- [Crow] No, I've been better.

1183
00:51:28,794 --> 00:51:31,282
