1185
00:51:34,019 --> 00:51:35,852
- I think I'll take a lift.

1186
00:51:35,852 --> 00:51:38,287
- [Whitsun] And you'll make it
out there before you know it.

1187
00:51:38,287 --> 00:51:42,037
