before the bar shuts.

1188
00:51:43,640 --> 00:51:45,044
- [Joel] Wow, they're so versatile.

1189
00:51:45,044 --> 00:51:47,877
It's kinda like Swan Lake-a-Go-Go.

1190
00:51:49,426 --> 00:51:51,570
- When does wonder boy reckon
we should go out again?

1191
00:51:51,570 --> 00:51:55,598
- Three days, according
to his box of tricks.

1192
00:51:55,598 --> 00:51:56,598
Wanna drink?

1193
00:51:57,467 --> 00:51:59,833
- Later, I am going to eat.

1194
00:51:59,833 --> 00:52:00,666
- [Crow] They made some extra cash

1195
00:52:00,666 --> 00:52:04,477
