00:52:14,625 --> 00:52:16,675
- [Joel] That Norm Crosby?

1201
00:52:16,675 --> 00:52:17,800
- [Crow] Or Corm Nosby.

1202
00:52:17,800 --> 00:52:18,951
- There's a lady been asking for you

1203
00:52:18,951 --> 00:52:20,564
for the past couple of days.

1204
00:52:20,564 --> 00:52:22,914
- [Joel] Space getup works every time.

1205
00:52:22,914 --> 00:52:24,810
- [Bill] What's she drinking?

1206
00:52:24,810 --> 00:52:25,890
- Green Mary.

1207
00:52:25,890 --> 00:52:26,723
- What?

1208
00:52:28,744 --> 00:52:30,758
- Rocket fuel and cabbage juice.

1209
00:52:30,758 --> 00:52:33,091
- [Crow] And a shot of bile.

1210
00:52:34,189 --> 00:52:36,690
- Which takes the taste away from which?

1211
00:52:36,690 --> 00:52:39,523
- I don't know, I only serve them.

1212
00:52:40,696 --> 00:52:43,113
- [Joel] And take your money.

1213
00:52:44,956 --> 00:52:46,995
- [Tom] You think he
tips himself outta that?

1214
00:52:46,995 --> 00:52:47,893
- [Joel] I don't know.

1215
00:52:47,893 --> 00:52:49,316
He's gonna have to file a chapter 13

1216
00:52:49,316 --> 00:52:51,505
