paying for the garnishes.

1218
00:52:52,960 --> 00:52:54,127
- [Joel] Yeah.

1219
00:52:56,022 --> 00:52:58,835
- [Tom] Hey, how's the egg coming?

1220
00:52:58,835 --> 00:53:00,031
